We are excited to welcome our new Pro Sports Client @camrynhannah. Cam was an outstanding student athlete in the ACC for @clemsonvb, and in the Big Ten for @pennstatevball. She helped the Nittany Lions wiin their eighth National Championship in Volleyball in 2024 while earning All-Championship honors.  She was a two-time second team All-ACC selection at Clemson, and All-Big Ten recipient in back to back seasons at Penn State. 

After college @camrynhannah was drafted in the first round of the Women’s pro volleyball league to the @vegasthrill , which had its inagural season in 2024. She had 177 points and 152 kills while playing for the @vegasthrill in 2025. For the 2026 season Cam will be playing for the @indyignitevb in the most popular Wonen’s pro sports city, Indianapolis. IN. 

@vlkprorep is expanding into other sports for men and women. Women’s sports on the college and pro level has been trending upward in the last three years and will continue to grow.  That is why we want to represent  Cam, and  provide her with all the NIL and marketing opportunities possible.  Our marketing team has already secured several leads since  signing with our agency. We will be Cheering @camrynhannah on this 2026 season! #provolleyball #pennstate #nittanylions #clemson  #tigers #clemsontigers #acc #natty #nationalchampionship #nationalchamps #allconference #nil #agent #marketing #branding #brand  #womenssports #womensvolleyball #drafted #firstround #indy #indyignite #indianapools

